# CP2K twin for regressions/dynamics/xl-bomd-linearized-stress (offline
# oracle — never run at ctest/regression time).
#
# CP2K 2026.1 has NO zero-SCF shadow-functional (linearized) XL-BOMD product,
# so the shadow stress itself cannot be twinned. What CP2K DOES pin is the
# multi-k Born-Oppenheimer stress surface the shadow must track to O((D-n)^2):
# this input is the converged-SCF k-point NVE twin (identical geometry/settings
# to xl-bomd-linearized-kpoints) with STRESS_TENSOR + per-step MOTION PRINT
# STRESS so the diagonal σ(t) trace anchors leg A of the ATV regression.
#
# Same-basis / same-PP twin:
#   basis  DZV-GTH-PADE
#   PP     GTH-PADE-q1
#   XC     PADE, CUTOFF 300 Ry, NGRIDS 1, MP 1x1x2 FULL_GRID (2 k, w = 1/2)
#   cell   cubic 12 Bohr, H at (5.5, 6, 6) and (6.5, 6, 6) Bohr
#   MD     NVE, dt 0.5 fs, 4 steps, v0 = -/+0.001 Angstrom/fs along x
#
# Run (Arrhenius login node, offline):
#   export OMP_NUM_THREADS=8
#   cp2k -i h2_xl_linearized_stress_nve.inp -o h2_xl_linearized_stress_nve.out
# Pin: per-step Pot from PROJECT-1.ener + diagonal σ [bar] from PROJECT-1.stress
#      (convert bar → Ha/Bohr³ with 1 Ha/Bohr³ = 2.94210107994716e8 bar).
&GLOBAL
  PROJECT h2_xl_linearized_stress_nve
  RUN_TYPE MD
  PRINT_LEVEL LOW
&END GLOBAL
&MOTION
  &MD
    ENSEMBLE NVE
    STEPS 4
    TIMESTEP 0.5
  &END MD
  &PRINT
    &STRESS on
      &EACH
        MD 1
      &END EACH
    &END STRESS
  &END PRINT
&END MOTION
&FORCE_EVAL
  METHOD Quickstep
  STRESS_TENSOR ANALYTICAL
  &PRINT
    &FORCES ON
    &END FORCES
    &STRESS_TENSOR
      COMPONENTS
    &END STRESS_TENSOR
  &END PRINT
  &DFT
    BASIS_SET_FILE_NAME BASIS_SET
    POTENTIAL_FILE_NAME GTH_POTENTIALS
    &MGRID
      CUTOFF 300
      NGRIDS 1
    &END MGRID
    &QS
      METHOD GPW
      EPS_DEFAULT 1.0E-10
      EXTRAPOLATION USE_PREV_P
    &END QS
    &SCF
      SCF_GUESS ATOMIC
      EPS_SCF 1.0E-7
      MAX_SCF 60
      &DIAGONALIZATION
        ALGORITHM STANDARD
      &END DIAGONALIZATION
      &MIXING
        METHOD DIRECT_P_MIXING
        ALPHA 0.3
      &END MIXING
    &END SCF
    &XC
      &XC_FUNCTIONAL PADE
      &END XC_FUNCTIONAL
    &END XC
    &KPOINTS
      SCHEME MONKHORST-PACK 1 1 2
      FULL_GRID .TRUE.
    &END KPOINTS
    &POISSON
      PERIODIC XYZ
      PSOLVER PERIODIC
    &END POISSON
  &END DFT
  &SUBSYS
    &CELL
      ABC [bohr] 12.0 12.0 12.0
      PERIODIC XYZ
    &END CELL
    &COORD
      UNIT bohr
      H  5.5  6.0  6.0
      H  6.5  6.0  6.0
    &END COORD
    &KIND H
      BASIS_SET DZV-GTH-PADE
      POTENTIAL GTH-PADE-q1
    &END KIND
    &VELOCITY
      -4.5710290E-05  0.0  0.0
       4.5710290E-05  0.0  0.0
    &END VELOCITY
  &END SUBSYS
&END FORCE_EVAL
